Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- The window was 940 wide with no limit on rows, so long lines were cut off and about 18 or more rows ran off the frame; the window grows to the longest line and shrinks to fit both its width and its rows.

